# INTELLIGENT TEMPLATE BUILDER - SYSTEM MEMORY FILE
# Created: January 2025
# Purpose: Comprehensive system memory for future development and improvements

## PROJECT OVERVIEW
Project Name: Intelligent Template Builder for UK Financial Advisors
Primary Purpose: Create, manage, and utilize document templates for UK Financial Advisory reports with AI-powered intelligence
Target Users: UK Financial Advisors, Advisory Firms, Compliance Teams
Deployment: GitHub Pages for zero-cost hosting and easy sharing

## USER REQUIREMENTS (ORIGINAL REQUEST)
1. Build intelligent system that analyzes Annual Review Reports and Suitability Reports
2. Extract patterns from unstructured documents and create structured templates
3. Interactive system accessible via GitHub link for easy sharing and testing
4. Must work with UK Financial Conduct Authority (FCA) requirements
5. Should allow users to input any template and generate template builders
6. Need comprehensive documentation and memory file for future improvements

## SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE

### Core Components
1. Template Engine (template-engine.js)
   - Pattern recognition using regular expressions
   - Financial data extraction (clients, dates, currency, percentages, providers)
   - Template generation for Annual Review and Suitability Report types
   - Document validation and generation capabilities

2. Application Controller (app.js)
   - UI management and navigation
   - File processing (text and PDF support)
   - Template CRUD operations
   - Local storage integration for privacy
   - Interactive form generation

3. User Interface (index.html)
   - Bootstrap 5 responsive design
   - Multi-section layout: welcome, analyze, templates, generate, demo, help
   - Drag-and-drop file upload
   - Modal-based interactions

4. Styling (styles.css)
   - Modern CSS with custom properties
   - Dark mode support
   - Mobile-responsive design
   - Animation and transition effects

## TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS

### Pattern Recognition Patterns
```javascript
client_name: /(?:Prepared For:|Client:|Name:)\s*([A-Z][a-zA-Z\s]+)/gi
date: /(\d{1,2}\s+(?:January|February|March|April|May|June|July|August|September|October|November|December)\s+\d{4})/gi
currency: /£([\d,]+(?:\.\d{2})?)/g
percentage: /(\d+\.?\d*%)/g
provider: /Provider:\s*([A-Z][A-Za-z\s]+)/gi
investment_product: /(?:Fund|Investment|Product|Portfolio):\s*([A-Za-z\s&]+)/gi
risk_level: /(?:Risk Level|Risk Category|Risk Profile):\s*([A-Za-z\s]+)/gi
recommendation: /(?:Recommendation|Advice|Action):\s*([A-Za-z\s,\.]+)/gi
```

### File Structure
```
intelligent-template-builder/
├── index.html              # Main application page
├── styles.css              # Application styling
├── template-engine.js      # Core template processing
├── app.js                  # Application logic
├── README.md               # Documentation
├── TEMPLATE_BUILDER_DOCUMENTATION.md # Technical docs
└── TEMPLATE_BUILDER_MEMORY.tmp # This memory file
```

### Local Storage Schema
```javascript
// Templates stored as JSON objects
{
  id: "template_uuid",
  name: "Template Name",
  type: "annual_review|suitability_report|generic",
  created: "2025-01-31T00:00:00.000Z",
  sections: [
    {
      title: "Section Name",
      fields: [
        {
          name: "field_name",
          type: "text|number|date|select|textarea",
          label: "Field Label",
          required: true,
          value: "",
          options: [] // for select fields
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  originalContent: "Original document content",
  metadata: { /* additional info */ }
}
```

