## KNOWN LIMITATIONS
1. PDF processing requires external library (pdf-lib) - implemented
2. No server-side persistence (by design for privacy)
3. Limited to browser capabilities for file processing
4. Pattern recognition may need refinement for edge cases
5. No real-time collaboration features

## COMPLIANCE CONSIDERATIONS
- UK FCA compliance ready templates
- Consumer Duty regulations support
- Data privacy (local storage only)
- No data transmission to external servers
- Audit trail capabilities through local logs

